# Master's Councillors, a 1/3 with vigilance: "gets +2/+0 for each graveyard with seven or more cards in it" and "Whenever you draw your
# second card each turn, target player mills three cards." Cast on turn 3 and Ancestral Recall (the second draw of the turn) makes Bot2 mill
# three; on turn 5 the second Ancestral Recall makes it mill three more: six cards in Bot2's graveyard, and the Councillors still has power
# 1 (? line). On turn 6 Bot2's Lightning Bolt goes to its graveyard as the seventh: power 3, and a toughness of 3 (the +2/+0 is power only).

